  "description": "SINGLE STOREY REAR AND SIDE EXTENSION",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed rear and side\r\nextension, by reason of their combined design, siting and massing, would result\r\nin a prominent, visually intrusive, form of development to the detriment of the\r\nvisual amenity, and leading to an undue sense of enclosure of the neighbouring\r\nproperty of no.54 Cliveden Road, and the surrounding area in general. The\r\nscheme would be contrary to the London Plan design policies D1, D4, Merton Local Plan 2024 policies D12.1,\r\nD12.3, D12.4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
